{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/796852-songs-of-darkness-post-your-wod-music-ambient-music","id":796852,"title":"Songs of Darkness: post your WoD Music/Ambient music","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-30T08:32:20-08:00","id":796852,"title":"Songs of Darkness: post your WoD Music/Ambient music","content":"im a firm believer of using music in games, to give a taste or a flavour to certain elements. Which songs do you use? either for a mood ambient or just as Hints?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDPljnaNL5o\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDPljnaNL5o</a> for my more urban/rave games set within the mage the ascension universe<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CdPiX0rPEbw\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CdPiX0rPEbw</a> For the Technocracy and to depict the &quot;Statical&quot; world<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1tWP5vUXrdc\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1tWP5vUXrdc</a> i usually use this cover when my players learn that they can Fight Back against the technocracy<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DpRUKLKCY-w\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DpRUKLKCY-w</a> im using this song to explain The Umbra as well the Awakening of a Mage.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9GaL6xqTOAs\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9GaL6xqTOAs</a> Conversations with The Men in Black<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dVqN-jbOxag\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dVqN-jbOxag</a> Welcome to Malfeas.<br /> <br /> For vampire the masquerade , i usually go with some of these<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WPpDyIJdasg\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WPpDyIJdasg</a> For meetings or to give the Night time vibe<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FGuvgj2xtQY\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FGuvgj2xtQY</a> Any rooftop chase needs this :P<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zFj3vXp3R_M\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zFj3vXp3R_M</a> anytime one of my players discovers what is he capable of (i used it when one of my DtF players was being robbed and he discovered how to use his Apocalyptic Forms)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HaX3Dx_1o6g\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HaX3Dx_1o6g</a> im fond of using this for chases as well. dunno why, maybe because of how vibrant and how the electronic effects gives the idea of constant movement<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1M4ADcMn3dA\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1M4ADcMn3dA</a> Dunno why, but to me this is The Pentex anthem, i just imagine people in a round table discussing &quot;figures.&quot; and charts, as we see through the windows the Breeding Grounds and fomori's being made.<br /> <br /> <br /> i might post some later on.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T17:37:58-08:00","id":797089,"title":"","conte